<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:36pt;text-align:justify"><i>Interactive Systems, Inc.</i></p>
<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align:justify">Provides software that helps manage all aspects of warehouse day-to-day operations including inventory management, e-commerce, order processing, and supports handheld devices for warehouse workers. The solution also features customized interfaces to automation and a variety of material handling equipment. </p>
