<p style="font:10pt Times New Roman;margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:4.5pt;text-align:justify">Wages and benefits increased from $597,212 to $13,421,833, an increase of $12,824,621, reflecting the employment base of approximately twenty acquired land surveying companies consolidated into the group's results for all or part of 2025. As of December 31, 2025, the DaaS </p>
