</td><td valign="bottom" style="padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000"><p style="font:9pt Times New Roman;margin:0;background-color:#FFFFFF;text-align:justify"><b>Estimated useful life</b></p>
