<tr><td valign="bottom" style="padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000"><p style="font:9pt Times New Roman;margin:0;text-align:justify">Utility Patents US11597515B2 and US11970293B2</p>
